{"id":"2afdb06f05dacdb0","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-creative-set.md","title":"Creative Set","display":"df-creative-set — Creative Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-creative-set","aliases":["68-df-creative-set"],"display":"df-creative-set — Creative Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§17 creating function and creative set, p.63 / PDF 72","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-creative-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-creative-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-creative-set — Creative Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§17 creating function and creative set, p.63 / PDF 72"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec},\\mathrm{RE},W_e\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec},\\mathrm{RE},W_e\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creating}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creating}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> 为下式引入的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creating}(F,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;F\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl((e,y)\\in F\\land(y\\in A\\leftrightarrow y\\in W_e)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Creating}(F,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;F\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl((e,y)\\in F\\land(y\\in A\\leftrightarrow y\\in W_e)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\exists F\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\mathrm{Creating}(F,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\exists F\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\mathrm{Creating}(F,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §17，印刷 p.63 / PDF p.72，先定义 creating function，再定义具有这种函数的 RE 集为 creative。这里恢复原书的精确接口，取代原先仅用补集 productive 条件的定义。若 W_e⊆N∖A，creating 等价式迫使 F(e) 同时避开 A 与 W_e，因此得到补集的生产性；反向是额外的递归论等价结果，不能以术语同名代替证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec},\\mathrm{RE},W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creating}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creating}(F,A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;F\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl((e,y)\\in F\\land(y\\in A\\leftrightarrow y\\in W_e)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\exists F\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\mathrm{Creating}(F,A).","display":true}],"bytes":1569,"backlinks":[{"id":"719191db2e194527","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Creative},\\mathrm{Creating}$ 见 [[68-df-creative-set]]，$\\mathrm{mComplete}$ 见 [[68-df-m-completeness]]。参数化所用递归函数编号见 [[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]。"},{"id":"b933761613d185b9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-creative-set]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-creative-set]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-creative-set|df-creative-set — Creative Set]]"}],"outgoing":["a82d826d433dcff3","913d52943499d039"]}